        "materials": "<p>100% organic cotton jersey, bio washed and silicone washed for a smooth, soft finish. Every panel is laundered before it is stitched (cut panel laundry), so the tee is pre-shrunk. Taped neck and shoulders, overlocked side seams, flatlock finishing and double-needle hems. Colours are lab tested for colour-fastness, and prints use OEKO-TEX certified inks.</p><p>Machine wash cold with like colours, tumble dry low, and iron on the reverse. Do not bleach or dry clean.</p>"
